    "Background colour is fixed at 8 and object colours are distinct and never 8.",
    "Objects are 4-connected single components and are separated by at least one background cell in the 8-neighbourhood, so component extraction is unambiguous under either connectivity or colour-awareness.",
    "At least one object has bounding-box width >= 3 so the output is never fully blank, and every object loses at least one column so the output is never identical to the input.",
    "At least one object is left-ragged (a row that does not reach its left bbox column), distinguishing column-of-bbox trimming from per-row trimming."
